# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  ATK FRONTEND SERVER (10.106.6.228)
#  Frontend builder + Nginx only.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
#  This host has no secrets. The browser-facing endpoints are NOT read from
#  here — they live in ./config/app-config.json (and the legacy ./config/
#  config.json), which are loaded at runtime by the SPA.
#
#  For reference, the endpoints currently configured there:
#    backend.api.baseUrl    https://backend-atkdev.familydollar.com/api
#    auth.keycloak.url      https://sso-atkdev.familydollar.com/auth
#    externalLinks.*        https://backend-atkdev.familydollar.com/grafana
#    iframes.agentGateway   https://backend-atkdev.familydollar.com/ui/
#
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# autonomousitopstoolkitdev -> 10.106.6.228 (this VM)
# sso-atkdev / vault-atkdev / backend-atkdev -> 10.106.6.15 (core VM)
FRONTEND_DNS=autonomousitopstoolkitdev.familydollar.com
BACKEND_DNS=backend-atkdev.familydollar.com
KEYCLOAK_DNS=sso-atkdev.familydollar.com
VAULT_DNS=vault-atkdev.familydollar.com
